{"id":"73782856c9b2f46a","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-diagonal-pullback.md","title":"Diagonal Pullback and Conditions G1–G3","display":"df-diagonal-pullback — Diagonal Pullback and Conditions G1–G3","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-diagonal-pullback","aliases":["92-df-diagonal-pullback"],"display":"df-diagonal-pullback — Diagonal Pullback and Conditions G1–G3","source":"第 I 章，pp. 6–8、练习 6（PDF 23–25、29）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language]]","[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-diagonal-pullback"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-diagonal-pullback</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-diagonal-pullback — Diagonal Pullback and Conditions G1–G3"},{"key":"source","html":"第 I 章，pp. 6–8、练习 6（PDF 23–25、29）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1edb9c65c85c539f\" href=\"?note=1edb9c65c85c539f\" title=\"92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language\">92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8dcd8ee3e47cef44\" href=\"?note=8dcd8ee3e47cef44\" title=\"92-df-abstract-expressibility\">92-df-abstract-expressibility</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}\">\\(P_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}\\)</span> 如上游定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{G1},\\mathrm{G2},\\mathrm{G3}\">\\(\\mathrm{G1},\\mathrm{G2},\\mathrm{G3}\\)</span> 为下文定义的结构谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathcal L}^*\">\\(A_{\\mathcal L}^*\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 的集合逆像，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline A\">\\(\\overline A\\)</span> 为自然数域补集。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}pullback}\\vdash\\quad\nA_{\\mathcal L}^{*}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N\\mid d(n)\\in A\\},\\quad\n\\overline A\\coloneqq\\mathbb N\\setminus A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{G1}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A_{\\mathcal L}^{*})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{G2}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(\\overline A)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{G3}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(P_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}pullback}\\vdash\\quad\nA_{\\mathcal L}^{*}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N\\mid d(n)\\in A\\},\\quad\n\\overline A\\coloneqq\\mathbb N\\setminus A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{G1}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A_{\\mathcal L}^{*})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{G2}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(\\overline A)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{G3}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(P_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^*\">\\(A^*\\)</span> 是逆像，绝非对角函数的像。恒有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\overline A)^*=\\mathbb N\\setminus A^*\">\\((\\overline A)^*=\\mathbb N\\setminus A^*\\)</span>，包括非法码，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 是全函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{G1}\">\\(\\mathrm{G1}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{G2}\">\\(\\mathrm{G2}\\)</span> 是可表达集合类的封闭条件，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{G3}\">\\(\\mathrm{G3}\\)</span> 才涉及可证性；它们不是 P.A. 的三个算术公理。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 I 章，pp. 6–8、练习 6（PDF 23–25、29）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language","status":"resolved","id":"1edb9c65c85c539f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-abstract-expressibility","status":"resolved","id":"8dcd8ee3e47cef44","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"P_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{G1},\\mathrm{G2},\\mathrm{G3}","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\mathcal L}^*","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline A","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}pullback}\\vdash\\quad\nA_{\\mathcal L}^{*}&\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N\\mid d(n)\\in A\\},\\quad\n\\overline A\\coloneqq\\mathbb N\\setminus A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{G1}(\\mathcal L)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A_{\\mathcal L}^{*})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{G2}(\\mathcal L)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(\\overline A)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{G3}(\\mathcal L)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(P_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A^*","display":false},{"tex":"(\\overline A)^*=\\mathbb N\\setminus A^*","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{G1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{G2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{G3}","display":false}],"bytes":1953,"backlinks":[{"id":"2ae549c14f89182f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language]] → [[92-df-abstract-expressibility]] → [[92-df-diagonal-pullback]] → [[92-lem-abstract-diagonal]]。"},{"id":"97f80cc5c73f0d60","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1d0a7d81ddf7d082","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fc6f6230ad54a0dc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}$ 是抽象可表达性质；$\\mathrm{G1},\\mathrm{G2}$ 是[[92-df-diagonal-pullback]]的封闭条件；$T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[T]$。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonal-pullback]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonal-pullback]]"}],"outgoing":["1edb9c65c85c539f","8dcd8ee3e47cef44"]}